    "interpretation": "The selected policy is a synthetic candidate from a declared finite policy set; capacity gates prevent a paper-optimal but overloaded mode from winning, and the result is not a calibrated local optimum until OD, capacity, accessibility and satisfaction observations replace the assumptions."
